{"id":"1def9217c695e458","group":"18","path":"18/18-df-ordinal-cutoff.md","title":"Local Ordinal Cutoff Convention","display":"df-ordinal-cutoff — Local Ordinal Cutoff Convention","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Proof Theory — Wolfram Pohlers","book_abbrev":"18","label":"18-df-ordinal-cutoff","aliases":["18-df-ordinal-cutoff","18-df-067"],"display":"df-ordinal-cutoff — Local Ordinal Cutoff Convention","depends_on":["[[18-df-proof-theoretic-ordinal]]","[[18-df-feferman-schutte-ordinal]]"],"source_work":"Proof Theory: The First Step into Impredicativity (Springer, 2009)","source_section":"Local convention; compare §8.3 and Theorem 8.5.31","source_printed_pages":"134–136; 155","source_pdf_pages":"144–146; 165","verification_status":"locally-revised-not-machine-checked","eligible_as_verified_dependency":false,"source_proof_review":"未逐项复核原书证明","local_revision":"2026-10-14","local_review_scope":"definitions, syntax, explicit dependencies; not proof-assistant verification","prior_revision_verification_status":"local-convention","prior_eligible_as_verified_dependency":false},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Proof Theory — Wolfram Pohlers"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"18"},{"key":"label","html":"18-df-ordinal-cutoff"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>18-df-ordinal-cutoff</span><span>18-df-067</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-ordinal-cutoff — Local Ordinal Cutoff Convention"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"2053b1b724a60f4e\" href=\"?note=2053b1b724a60f4e\" title=\"18-df-proof-theoretic-ordinal\">18-df-proof-theoretic-ordinal</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"3df370596a981512\" href=\"?note=3df370596a981512\" title=\"18-df-feferman-schutte-ordinal\">18-df-feferman-schutte-ordinal</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_work","html":"Proof Theory: The First Step into Impredicativity (Springer, 2009)"},{"key":"source_section","html":"Local convention; compare §8.3 and Theorem 8.5.31"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"134–136; 155"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"144–146; 165"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"locally-revised-not-machine-checked"},{"key":"eligible_as_verified_dependency","html":"false"},{"key":"source_proof_review","html":"未逐项复核原书证明"},{"key":"local_revision","html":"2026-10-14"},{"key":"local_review_scope","html":"definitions, syntax, explicit dependencies; not proof-assistant verification"},{"key":"prior_revision_verification_status","html":"local-convention"},{"key":"prior_eligible_as_verified_dependency","html":"false"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal T\">\\(\\mathcal T\\)</span> 是一组带语言、算术实现和指定自由集合参数的理论呈示的集合，且每个 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T\\in\\mathcal T\">\\(T\\in\\mathcal T\\)</span> 都满足 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"2053b1b724a60f4e\" href=\"?note=2053b1b724a60f4e\" title=\"18-df-proof-theoretic-ordinal\">18-df-proof-theoretic-ordinal</a> 中证明论序数 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\|T\\|\">\\(\\|T\\|\\)</span> 的适用条件。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma_0\">\\(\\Gamma_0\\)</span> 为 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"3df370596a981512\" href=\"?note=3df370596a981512\" title=\"18-df-feferman-schutte-ordinal\">18-df-feferman-schutte-ordinal</a> 的 Feferman–Schütte 序数。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal T_{&lt;\\Gamma_0}\">\\(\\mathcal T_{&lt;\\Gamma_0}\\)</span> 是本地阈值分类记号；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Predicative}_{\\Gamma_0}\">\\(\\mathrm{Predicative}_{\\Gamma_0}\\)</span> 仅保留为旧稿的兼容别名。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal T_{&lt;\\Gamma_0}:=\n\\{T\\in\\mathcal T\\mid\\|T\\|&lt;\\Gamma_0\\},\n\\qquad\n\\mathrm{Predicative}_{\\Gamma_0}:=\\mathcal T_{&lt;\\Gamma_0}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathcal T_{&lt;\\Gamma_0}:=\n\\{T\\in\\mathcal T\\mid\\|T\\|&lt;\\Gamma_0\\},\n\\qquad\n\\mathrm{Predicative}_{\\Gamma_0}:=\\mathcal T_{&lt;\\Gamma_0}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>这是一项本地约定，不是 Pohlers 对“预测性”的定义或判据。原书 §8.3 从受限语言、证明长度和自主闭包 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Aut}(\\alpha)\">\\(\\operatorname{Aut}(\\alpha)\\)</span> 讨论狭义预测性，并在 Theorem 8.5.31 得到 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Aut}(\\omega)=\\Gamma_0\">\\(\\operatorname{Aut}(\\omega)=\\Gamma_0\\)</span>。仅按序数小于 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma_0\">\\(\\Gamma_0\\)</span> 分组不能代替该机制，也不能推出任意理论在哲学意义上预测性成立。</p>\n<p>旧名含 Predicative，现明确它只表示所声明集合 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal T\">\\(\\mathcal T\\)</span> 中的阈值分类。本册已有 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"c8f3a8371faa8691\" href=\"?note=c8f3a8371faa8691\" title=\"18-df-autonomous-closure\">18-df-autonomous-closure</a> 及 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"4b4b62cab0a0c1b1\" href=\"?note=4b4b62cab0a0c1b1\" title=\"18-thm-autonomous-gamma0\">18-thm-autonomous-gamma0</a>；这些具体接口不把本节点的任意理论族阈值分类变成无参数的预测性判据。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"18-df-proof-theoretic-ordinal","status":"resolved","id":"2053b1b724a60f4e","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[18-df-proof-theoretic-ordinal]]","embed":false},{"target":"18-df-feferman-schutte-ordinal","status":"resolved","id":"3df370596a981512","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[18-df-feferman-schutte-ordinal]]","embed":false},{"target":"18